sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    title WF2 - Conduct AI-assisted oral exam (planned design)
    actor Student
    participant UI as React UI
    participant API as ASP.NET API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Store as Object storage
    participant TTS as Text-to-Speech
    participant STT as Speech-to-Text
    participant AI as LLM / AI evaluation

    Note over Student,AI: Planned workflow, not implemented in Milestone 3. No API paths for audio or AI are finalized.
    Student->>UI: Join an Open exam session
    UI->>API: Join session with auth cookie and CSRF token
    API->>DB: Validate Open status and get/create exam_attempt
    DB-->>API: Attempt and ordered selected questions
    API-->>UI: Current main question

    loop For each main question
        API->>TTS: Convert question text to speech
        TTS-->>API: Question audio
        API-->>UI: Question text and audio reference
        UI-->>Student: Play question
        Student->>UI: Record spoken answer
        UI->>API: Submit answer audio (proposed)
        API->>Store: Save audio object
        Store-->>API: Audio object key
        API->>DB: Save answer and activity log
        API->>STT: Transcribe answer audio
        STT-->>API: Transcript and confidence
        API->>DB: Save transcript and service interaction log
        API->>DB: Read expected key points and rubric
        DB-->>API: Evaluation context
        API->>AI: Analyze question, transcript, key points and rubric
        AI-->>API: Score, analysis and next-action decision
        API->>DB: Save AI evaluation and interaction log

        alt Answer complete
            API-->>UI: Feedback and proceed to next main question
        else Missing key points
            API->>AI: Generate follow-up question
            AI-->>API: Follow-up text
            API->>DB: Save attempt question (AiFollowUp)
            API->>TTS: Convert follow-up to audio
            TTS-->>API: Follow-up audio
            API-->>UI: Follow-up question and audio reference
            UI-->>Student: Ask follow-up and collect next answer
            Note over Student,AI: Repeat answer, STT and AI evaluation for the follow-up.
        else Unclear or incorrect answer
            API->>AI: Generate probing question
            AI-->>API: Probing text
            API->>DB: Save attempt question and decision
            API->>TTS: Convert probing question to audio
            TTS-->>API: Probing audio
            API-->>UI: Probing question and audio reference
            UI-->>Student: Ask probing question and collect next answer
            Note over Student,AI: Repeat answer, STT and AI evaluation for the probe.
        end

        opt STT, TTS or AI service fails
            API->>DB: Record failed service interaction / activity
            API-->>UI: Retry or manual recovery error without completion
        end
    end

    API->>DB: Mark attempt Completed when no main questions remain (planned)
    API-->>UI: Exam finished. Report may be prepared for WF3
    UI-->>Student: Show completion state
